ing","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"And as Wheaton has by far the strongest free cash flow in the entire streaming space, at well over $100 million per quarter and over $1 billion of current capacity, we still have plenty of firepower for continued investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2017/11/13/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q3-2017-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2018 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2019-03-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"We also completed the largest acquisitions of the year in the streaming space by adding two new high-quality streams to our portfolio, Voisey's Bay and the Stillwater mines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/21/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q4-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2018 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2019-03-21","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Brown","x":"The increase in gold production was due primarily to the new streaming agreements relative to the San Dimas and Stillwater mines, partially offset by lower production at Sudbury and the other gold interests, including Minto, which was placed into care and maintenance in October of 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/21/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q4-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2018 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2019-03-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"And one of the advantages of the restructuring agreement is that we do have some delayed payments now if there's a delay.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/21/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q4-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2019 Q2","e":"wpm","d":"2019-08-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Brown","x":"The increase in gold production was due primarily to the new streaming agreements relative to the San Dimas and Stillwater mines, coupled with higher production at Sudbury, partially offset by lower production at the other gold interests, including Minto, which was placed in the care and…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/09/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2019 Q2","e":"wpm","d":"2019-08-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Haytham Hodaly","x":"We are seeing a lot of opportunities where silver and gold are a byproduct, which is exactly what you want to see for streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/09/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2019 Q2","e":"wpm","d":"2019-08-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gary Brown","x":"We want to be comfortable that that was a sustained price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/09/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q2-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2019 Q3","e":"wpm","d":"2019-11-15","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"And lastly, by being a leader among precious metal streamers in sustainability and supporting our partners and the communities in which we live and operate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/15/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q3-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2019 Q3","e":"wpm","d":"2019-11-15","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"And on the gold side, we are very pleased -- we continue to be very pleased with the outperformances of our gold assets, resulting in increased guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/15/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q3-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2019 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2020-03-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Brown","x":"This is just another financing tool that can be used in concert with operating cash flows and the credit capacity provided under its revolving credit facility to consummate additional accretive streaming transactions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/12/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2019 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2020-03-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Brown","x":"Our access to capital is critical in order that we can efficiently consummate new streaming transactions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/12/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2019 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2020-03-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gary Brown","x":"…a 14% increase relative to Q4 2018, primarily due to a 21% increase in the average realized gold price, an 18% increase in the average realized silver price and a 59% increase in the average realized palladium price, with these price increases being partially offset by the lower sales volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/12/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q4-2019-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2020 Q1","e":"wpm","d":"2020-05-08","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"The majority of the CSR fund, around $4 million will be targeted to the communities that are directly influenced by the mines in which we have precious metal streaming agreements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2020 Q1","e":"wpm","d":"2020-05-08","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"I think it's what makes Wheaton unique in the streaming space is the fact that we do put a lot of effort in terms of trying to provide additional support to our partners.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2020 Q1","e":"wpm","d":"2020-05-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gary Brown","x":"Revenue for the first quarter of 2020 amounted to $255 million representing a 13% increase relative to Q1 2019, primarily due to an 18% increase in the realized selling price on a gold equivalent basis with this price increase being totally outset by a 4% decrease in gold equivalent sales volumes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q1-2020-earnings.aspx"},{"c":"WPM 2020 Q2","e":"wpm","d":"2020-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"And so — but we still see opportunities where we think streaming is the best source of capital and a very competitive source of capital for these projects as they go forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/14/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q2-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2020 Q2","e":"wpm","d":"2020-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"And as we see stronger commodity prices, generally, there's not as much demand, but it is a market that's still streaming itself.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/14/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q2-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2020 Q2","e":"wpm","d":"2020-08-13","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"As already mentioned, we reduced our guidance for 2020 by only 5%, which should be put in context to the current market for precious metals, which year to date has seen gold and silver prices up by over 25% and 40%, respectively.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/14/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q2-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2020 Q3","e":"wpm","d":"2020-11-10","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Brown","x":"It is interesting to note that our GEO sales volume was 17% higher than that reported by any other streaming or royalty company in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2020 Q3","e":"wpm","d":"2020-11-10","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Gary Brown","x":"Again, it is worth noting that our revenue in Q3 2020 was 10% higher than any other streaming or royalty company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/11/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2020 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2021-03-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"On the corporate development front, despite travel restrictions, our team was busier than ever in 2020, announcing two new streaming agreements and reviewing these numerous and other opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/12/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2020 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2021-03-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"And as a streaming company, we recognize that the stronger our partners are, the stronger we are.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/12/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2020 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2021-03-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary Brown","x":"Look, Brian, you have to realize, we view the San Dimas restructuring that we did back in 2018 as a very successful transaction and a real win-win transaction, one that has benefited the First Majestic, who's done a wonderful job with the asset, with the exploration success that they've had.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/12/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2020 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2021-03-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary Brown","x":"So with that, I think, was a very successful restructuring and we're very happy with the way that that asset is performing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/12/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2021 Q1","e":"wpm","d":"2021-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Haytham Hodaly","x":"As you can see from the attached slide, we've ventured into a gold stream on a polymetallic acid, and that's exactly when streaming works best.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/08/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2021 Q1","e":"wpm","d":"2021-05-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Haytham Hodaly","x":"This project is a long-life asset with low operating costs falling in the first-class quartile that will continue to contribute to the high quality of our existing streaming portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/08/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2021 Q1","e":"wpm","d":"2021-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Haytham Hodaly","x":"They are working on an agreement to replace iron pipeline with rail option, so that -- so any different cost savings that this project is really only getting better.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/08/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2021 Q2","e":"wpm","d":"2021-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"The fund was designed to meet the immediate needs of communities that are directly influenced by the mines on which we have precious metal streaming agreements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/13/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2021 Q2","e":"wpm","d":"2021-08-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Haytham Hodaly","x":"I could also give a minute to update you on the streaming opportunity landscape.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/13/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2021 Q3","e":"wpm","d":"2021-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"And we are actively trying to put our strong balance sheet to work, looking at a number of precious metals streaming opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2021 Q3","e":"wpm","d":"2021-11-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"And our technical teams have been very active, visiting a number of potential new precious metals streaming opportunities as we strive to put our strong balance sheet to work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/wheaton-precious-metals-wpm-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"WPM 2021 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2022-03-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Haytham Hodaly","x":"By now, you've all noticed that we had a busy fourth quarter last year, announcing three-stream acquisitions to add to the two streaming transactions announced earlier in the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/11/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q4-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"WPM 2021 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2022-03-11","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Haytham Hodaly","x":"And turning to the next slide, our most recent streamer acquisition is from Sabina Gold & Silver on the Goose project at Back River located in Nunavut, Canada.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/11/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q4-2021-earnings/"},{"c":"WPM 2022 Q2","e":"wpm","d":"2022-08-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"This solid performance reflects the resiliency of the streaming model to inflationary pressures currently being felt across the global economy and especially among the traditional miners.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/12/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q2-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"WPM 2022 Q2","e":"wpm","d":"2022-08-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"The one thing about the streaming industry is these are life of mine investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/12/wheaton-precious-metals-corp-wpm-q2-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"WPM 2025 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2026-03-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"Our results were supported by strong contributions from cornerstone assets, including Salobo, Antamina and Peñasquito, alongside the continued ramp-up of Blackwater and Goose, further demonstrating the strength of our diversified streaming model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/13/wheaton-wpm-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WPM 2025 Q4","e":"wpm","d":"2026-03-13","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Randy Smallwood","x":"Last month, we also announced our 2026 and long-term guidance, which outlines Wheaton's expected production growth of 50% to 1.2 million gold equivalent ounces by 2030, a remarkable milestone for our company and a first for the broader streaming and royalty industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/13/wheaton-wpm-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"WPM 2026 Q1","e":"wpm","d":"2026-05-08","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Haytham Hodaly","x":"Looking ahead, we continue to see strong interest in streaming as a financing solution across the mining industry.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/wheaton-wpm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WPM 2026 Q1","e":"wpm","d":"2026-05-08","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Vincent Lau","x":"We strategically monetized a portion of our long-term investment portfolio, generating $323 million in proceeds and a $150 million gain, and redeployed the capital into our core streaming business to support funding of the Antamina BHP stream, which closed on April 1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/wheaton-wpm-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"WPM 2026 Q2","e":"wpm","d":"2026-08-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Haytham Hodaly","x":"In an environment marked by commodity price volatility and cost pressures, these results reflect the continued strength of our high-quality portfolio and the resilience of the streaming business model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/